    which the poset is Macaulay
  * *note isAdditive: isAdditive, -- whether a poset is additive
  * *note upperShadow: upperShadow, -- the upper shadow of a subset of a poset
  * *note lowerShadow: lowerShadow, -- the lower shadow of a subset of a poset

