ringConnectedSum -- constructs the connected sum of several rings
*****************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        ringConnectedSum(I, J, ...)
        ringConnectedSum(S, T, ...)
  * Inputs:
      * I, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, a homogeneous ideal of a *note
        PolynomialRing: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,.
      * J, an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, a homogeneous ideal of a *note
        PolynomialRing: (Macaulay2Doc)PolynomialRing,.
      * S, a *note quotient ring: (Macaulay2Doc)QuotientRing,, a quotient of a
        polynomial ring by a homogeneous ideal
      * T, a *note quotient ring: (Macaulay2Doc)QuotientRing,, a quotient of a
        polynomial ring by a homogeneous ideal
  * Outputs:
      * an *note ideal: (Macaulay2Doc)Ideal,, 
      * a *note quotient ring: (Macaulay2Doc)QuotientRing,, 

Description
===========

Suppose we have Gorenstein rings $S_1 = R_1/I_1$ and $S_2 = R_2/I_2$ for some
homogeneous ideals $I_1$ of $R_1 = K[x_1, \dots, x_n]$ and $I_2$ of $R_2 =
K[y_1, \dots, y_m]$, where $K$ is a field. Let $m_1, m_2$ be the maximal
elements of the *note monomial posets: getMons, of $S_1, S_2$, respectively.
The connected sum of $S_1$ and $S_2$ is their *note fiber product:
ringFiberProduct, mod $m_1-m_2$. In symbols, $S_1 \# S_2 = \frac{S_1 \times_K
S_2}{(m_1-m_2)}$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = (ZZ/2)[u,v,w]                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : I = ideal(u^4, v^2-w^2, w^2-v*u)                                        |
|                                                                             |
|             4   2    2         2                                            |
|o2 = ideal (u , v  + w , u*v + w )                                           |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : Ideal of R                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : S = R/I                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = S                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : T = newRing(S, Variables=>{x,y,z})                                      |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = T                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : U = ringConnectedSum(S, T)                                              |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = U                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : QuotientRing                                                            |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : ideal U                                                                 |
|                                                                             |
|             4   2    2         2   4   2    2         2                     |
|o6 = ideal (u , v  + w , u*v + w , x , y  + z , x*y + z , u*x, u*y, u*z, v*x,|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                               5    5                                        |
|     v*y, v*z, w*x, w*y, w*z, w  + z )                                       |
|                                                                             |
|              ZZ                                                             |
|o6 : Ideal of --[u..z]                                                       |
|               2                                                             |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : isMacaulay S                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = true                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : isMacaulay U                                                            |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = false                                                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

