upperShadow -- the upper shadow of a subset of a poset
******************************************************

  * Usage: 
        upperShadow(P,S)
  * Inputs:
      * P, an instance of the type *note Poset: (Posets)Poset,, 
      * S, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, a subset of the ground set of the
        poset
  * Outputs:
      * a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 

Description
===========

If $S$ is a subset of a poset, then the upper shadow of $S$ is the set of all
elements of the poset which cover some element of $S$.

+------------------------------------------+
|i1 : upperShadow(divisorPoset 12, {2,3})  |
|                                          |
|o1 = {4, 6}                               |
|                                          |
|o1 : List                                 |
+------------------------------------------+
|i2 : S = QQ[x,y]/(x^4, y^4)               |
|                                          |
|o2 = S                                    |
|                                          |
|o2 : QuotientRing                         |
+------------------------------------------+
|i3 : x = S_0                              |
|                                          |
|o3 = x                                    |
|                                          |
|o3 : S                                    |
+------------------------------------------+
|i4 : y = S_1                              |
|                                          |
|o4 = y                                    |
|                                          |
|o4 : S                                    |
+------------------------------------------+
|i5 : upperShadow(getPoset S, {x^3, x^2*y})|
|                                          |
|       3    2 2                           |
|o5 = {x y, x y }                          |
|                                          |
|o5 : List                                 |
+------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note lowerShadow: lowerShadow, -- the lower shadow of a subset of a poset

